WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:02,230
what do you think

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,520
Let me go too

3
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:09,190
Let me die together, husband, you

4
00:00:09,190 --> 00:00:13,430
I have indulged her too much all this time

5
00:00:13,430 --> 00:00:14,820
can you blame me

6
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:17,850
Obviously that is also a matter of salvation.

7
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:19,860
Think about it yourself

8
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,380
How much trouble have you gotten into?

9
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:22,420
Which time

10
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:23,620
When was it not your sister and I?

11
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:25,420
I'll risk my life to wipe your ass from behind.

12
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:27,180
You just pushed your sister to die

13
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:29,020
Do you or she have any conscience?

14
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:30,340
Wife, listen to me

15
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:31,260
You raise your head now

16
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:32,540
Seriously apologize to the female boss

17
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:33,660
beg her to let us go

18
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:34,740
Since she gave her passport

19
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:35,740
It means there is still life

20
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,220
Let's go back to the hotel and have a good time

21
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:38,740
I try to kill the Zanjin River

22
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:41,580
Is it okay to try to have a baby next year? It’s my sister. You have to do it for her.

23
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:43,020
Will you kill me too?

24
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,060
You see clearly

25
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:46,420
Just now she pushed you into the pile of losses, sister.

26
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:52,950
I am the sister of your memories

27
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:54,470
It's because I gave the gift too much

28
00:00:54,470 --> 00:00:56,030
I don't ask for your forgiveness

29
00:00:56,030 --> 00:00:57,750
I just ask you to let my husband go

30
00:00:57,750 --> 00:01:00,970
She did nothing wrong sister

31
00:01:00,970 --> 00:01:02,730
Are you still apologizing to that shady shop owner?

32
00:01:02,730 --> 00:01:04,730
Sorry sister

33
00:01:04,730 --> 00:01:05,810
I give her my life back
